    "body": "Beans Route allows you to upload multiple signatures for MMR reports.  To create a digital signature, follow the steps below. Go to www.signaturely.com 1.  Create a free account and sign in. 2.  Select Edit Signature  3.  Select Create Signature  4.  Type your Full Name and Initials in each box and select a font OR select \"Draw it in\" and use your mouse to create your signature.  5.  Take a screenshot of your signature (Hint: crop the screenshot to remove white space with around the signature).",
